e.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"His transcripts, available through the university's registrar's office, reveal a stellar academic record, marked by a consistent stream of high grades and academic honors.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"These achievements are a direct result of his tireless efforts, as well as the guidance and mentorship provided by MIT's distinguished faculty.\"}]}"
